    biomarkers: ["Mismatch repair protein loss on immunohistochemistry, or microsatellite instability, on every colorectal cancer at diagnosis", "MLH1 promoter methylation and BRAF V600E testing to separate sporadic from inherited mismatch repair loss", "Germline testing of MLH1, MSH2, MSH6, PMS2 and EPCAM to confirm the diagnosis and to test relatives"],
